cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SKNY in your research, please cite the paper below
  (preferred) and, optionally, this software repository.
type: software
title: "SKNY (SpatialKNifeY): spatial omics analysis of the tumor microenvironment"
abstract: >-
  SKNY (SpatialKNifeY) is a Python package for single-cell spatial omics data
  (10x Xenium, NanoString CosMx, Akoya PhenoCycler and other AnnData-compatible
  platforms). It delineates tumor spatial domains, measures the distance of every
  location or cell from the tumor border and quantifies gene expression and
  cell density in the tumor core, the peri-tumoral margin and distant tissue.
authors:
